      "title": "Crowdfunded genomes and the plant genome big bang",
      "abstract": "<p>&lt;strong&gt;\n Bauhinia Genome Update\n&lt;/strong&gt;\nWhile we\u2019ve been quiet on the blog things are still progressing in the world of Bauhinia Genome. Data has been continued to be analysed by students at CUHK and their transcriptome assemblies have been made public from the\n&lt;em&gt;\n GigaScience\n&lt;/em&gt;\nGigaDB platform. Prof Stephen Tsui presented this work at the International Botanical Conference last summer, and you can download the poster here.</p>",
